  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "According to a post from Fusl on 2020/2/18, the 'X days ago' as seen on the website when someone is offline only counts for when the API last detected a person inputting their credentials and logging into the website / app and doesn't count when they're still logged in and either browse the site or open the app.\n(https://vrchat.canny.io/website-bug-reports/p/friends-list-time-since-last-login-inaccurate)\n\"The last login currently really just shows the time of the last login, not the time of the last activity, so when a user starts up VRChat or opens the website again and they're still logged in, the last login time does not update.\"\nConsidering how little you're asked to log in, \"Last Login\" does not update frequently at all. It would be great if this could be changed to \"Most Recent Activity\" so you can easily tell just how long ago someone has been active on the website or app.",
